{"server":"tw","storyId":"act37side_level_act37side_04_end","groupId":"act37side","stageId":"act37side_04","title":"酒精與安慰劑","storyCode":"GO-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act37side/level_act37side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"856b13a61af2051546c5a1c61614dfd15527b59ea3e451a4d481a639b3e2e73e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g1_battlefieldoutside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……少尉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希勒……少尉……快……起來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"narration","text":"他看到了一雙手伸向了自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戴……戴菲恩小姐？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，我背著你，我們得趕快撤回我們攻下來的安全駐地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能還會有更多薩卡茲部隊來搜查或用巫術炸彈攔截我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我——謝謝您——救了我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必謝我，救你的是一位英勇的士兵，也是一位盡責的護理師——莎拉女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她強行催動還不熟練的源石技藝，擋下了巫術炸彈的爆炸，保護了那些還在轉運的傷員們，當然，也包括你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是她……等等，難道她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，她只是昏過去了。我們已經把她帶回接駁口的臨時駐地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你們都暴露在極高濃度的源石粉塵環境中太久……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐，所以……你們成功了？抵達接駁口了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到城牆上的火……熄滅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"城牆之戰……已經結束了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這場仗才剛開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食腐者仰仗著城防炮以及最精銳的部隊與公爵聯軍僵持不下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我們……能做點什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突破接駁口，為聯軍開出一道缺口，逼薩卡茲露出破綻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像聯軍“幫”我們一樣……儘管這並非他們的本意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了——咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希勒少尉，接下來的任務你不用參加。這是命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是推進之王的命令——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少尉，留在接駁口的駐地，你現在需要的是休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g15_customs"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>城牆接駁口，典範軍臨時駐地</><p=2>1098年9月25日 8:21 A.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們歡樂地歌唱♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"願廣闊的大地庇佑吾王♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"……庇佑他的子民與他的福祉♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"賜予我們無盡的恩典♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，你怎麼不唱啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，別一副愁眉苦臉的樣子！大家不都帶著傷嗎？但我們已經快到家門口了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們歡樂地歌唱♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞，我的故鄉！♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維、維多利亞……我的故鄉！♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，我的口糧吃不完，分你一點吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是我們回家後的第一頓早餐，當然得吃飽一點！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們的大部隊進了城，就讓那些魔族佬們見識一下誰才是倫蒂尼姆真正的主人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，我不喜歡這首歌……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你說呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別問她了，她自己有時候睡覺都還會哼這首歌呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因陀羅，你有這空閒不如多吃幾口飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者乾脆分給我，等一下突擊行動我來打頭陣。畢竟你在突進赦罪師密道的時候受了傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想得美，這點小傷根本沒差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我揍人時可不會被這種傷拖累。達格達，這次你別想搶在我前面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吃完了，我帶人再巡邏一圈確認周圍狀況，確保行動萬無一失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然軍委會選擇布防在只有修築城牆工人們才知道的備用接駁口，代表他們對城內的掌控範圍可能遠超我們的預期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐，巡邏工作我已經完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，可以分我一些口糧嗎？我還沒吃早餐呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少尉？！你……你不是受傷還在休息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我是軍醫。我很清楚該怎麼最快讓一名士兵恢復戰鬥力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩小姐，我很清楚自己的狀況。我現在正式歸隊，參與你們的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少尉，你把防護設備讓給傷員，自己卻暴露在高濃度源石環境裡，還正面承受巫術炸彈的衝擊……那你應該很清楚自己的身體狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然知道。雖然沒辦法做血液檢測，但我很清楚感染後會發生什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何？在這裡，這算是什麼特別的事嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他環顧四周，典範軍的士兵們擠在不算寬敞的通道附近。\n塵土與源石粉塵成了他們臉上最好的偽裝，但他們的眼神卻始終沒有一刻黯淡。\n他們很清楚自己在做什麼，也清楚將要付出什麼代價。\n但現在，他們在歌唱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，戴菲恩，你同意少尉歸隊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"戴菲恩看向希勒少尉的手，他試圖藏在身後的東西還是被她看到了——一支止痛劑。\n在難以獲得足夠的礦石病抑制劑時，止痛劑是唯一能緩解疼痛的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你撐得住嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。戴菲恩小姐，別忘了，我還想親眼見證您回家，拿回本該屬於您的東西呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……本來可以不用參與的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不也一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然您想看到這支隊伍能走到何處，這座城市會變成什麼樣子，那我也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好，少尉，歸隊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜老大，等我們把那些魔族佬全趕跑後，倫蒂尼姆會變成什麼樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定會比以前好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我就希望城裡多開幾家花店，這樣花的價格能便宜一點，我才好找位有錢的小姐或剛喪夫的夫人結婚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"積極的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望源石燃料能多一點，爐子燒得更旺，冬天別再這麼冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_241","isRemote":false,"text":"……我希望能有更多的好警察局，自己能當個好警察，最好真的能幫到別人，而不是只會剝削別人的血汗錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悲傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我只希望回家的時候，媽媽還會在門口等著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，當然會的！等我們回家了，你媽媽一定會在門口迎接你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"達格達，你呢？要繼續跟我們一起重建拳館，還是躲回你的塔樓裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漢娜，我還沒跟你打夠呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，到時候，我們一起回拳館！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然……我們會回家的……但我們還沒找到貝爾德呢……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>跨進家門的這一步，我們足足走了三天。</i>\n\\n<i>而迎接我們的，是工廠噴出的漫天蒸汽。</i>\n<i>但……更多的人卻倒在了家門前。他們唱著歌，走進通道的深處，卻再也沒有回來。</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g5_victoriaspeakeasy"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>“一鎊十杯”酒館</><p=2>1098年12月21日 5:25 P.M.</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜老大，這杯我請你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"我們雖然把魔族佬趕出去了，但他們可沒死光！他們手上還有能讓整座城市飄滿源石塵的技術，肯定還會再打回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯莽的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那些公爵，要是哪天又出了什麼事，他們還是不會管我們死活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯莽的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是你說的，我們得有保護自己的力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯莽的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以啊，我根本不信外面那些傳言——“解散典範軍”，你說對吧，維娜老大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……還記得那天我們在接駁口說過的願望嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望工廠的爐火能像以前一樣旺盛，城牆上的城防炮能像過去一樣守護倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有希望每個區的警察局都能敞開大門，警察不再對貴族唯命是從，也不會無端驅趕感染者……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望唯一的規則是議會通過的法律……這一直是我的目標，我也在努力實現它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你們滿意現在的倫蒂尼姆嗎？它變得更好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魯莽的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_408_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"興奮的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，說實話我並不滿意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1520_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在避重就輕，議長閣下，他們並他們不是在質問你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1520_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你什麼都不做，讓典範軍維持現狀，至少現在大家還能接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1520_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們只想要一個確切的答案——典範軍還能繼續存在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少尉，這就是我的回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"議會擔心你們對我的信任已經超過了對議會的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許他們害怕的是典範軍終究會變成維娜·維多利亞的私軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我害怕的是，到了那時典範軍還能維持它的榮耀嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們當初許下的願望真的能有實現的一天嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1520_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝你們，我會將今天瞭解到的情況轉告議會。畢竟我也沒有資格擅自做決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，我們走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜，你先走吧。我想留下來陪大家喝幾杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>那天，我沒能完全理解維娜的意思。</i>\n\\n<i>但我贊同少尉的看法——典範軍的戰友需要我們的幫助……所以我留下來了，替維娜留下，至少陪他們聊聊天。</i>\n\\n<i>明明她已經是議長了，明明她能做的事情比誰都多……</i>\n<i>戰爭結束後的第一次，我喝得爛醉，那裡的烈酒嗆得我胃痛。</i>\n\\n<i>最後是漢娜找到我。我終於鼓起勇氣問了她一個一直不敢問維娜的問題——</i>\n<i>“我們什麼時候才能回家？回到我們的拳館？”</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g7_towngreenhouse"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藥草長得很好，黛安看到一定會很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當初農場重建時，多虧她說服工程隊把那些損壞的光照設備留下來，改裝成功率較低的小型溫室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊，抱歉，剛剛我們聊到哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您最近的身體狀況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您剛才提到自己的源石技藝出現了跨越式強化的跡象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，抱歉，我的記性越來越差了，總是恍神，醫生說源石已經蔓延到腦裡了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我是不是已經跟你講過好幾次了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別在意，我們只是聊聊天，您想說什麼都可以。最近還有其他不尋常的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走路變得很難走直線？不過這應該不算什麼，很多人都有這種狀況吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"共濟失調……倫蒂尼姆的很多感染者都有類似的症狀，但目前我對此沒什麼頭緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有啊，最近趁著獨處時我總會忍不住偷偷嘗試……真奇怪，我的源石技藝好像變了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變了？之前的報告裡沒提到——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，莎拉女士，請您繼續說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，您是徒手施法的嗎？我想醫生應該提醒過您，這樣做會讓病情更難控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，您就跟黛安說的一樣，真是個愛操心的採訪者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我總是想用這種方式，在自己愈發混沌的腦海裡找回那場戰役的記憶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說城牆之戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您曾提到當時您還是名護理師，試圖用源石技藝抵擋巫術炸彈的爆炸，但……效果並不理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我只記得那時我緊跟在希勒少尉身後，結果被巨大的衝擊力拋飛了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我醒來時已經躺在臨時醫院，然後得知我和身邊的人都成了急性感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會變成這樣呢，埃利西奧先生……我甚至不知道到底有多少顆巫術炸彈落在了典範軍之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"療養院患者","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼多人的命運在一瞬間被徹底改寫……可是我卻什麼都沒看清，什麼也回想不起來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……莎拉女士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃利西奧察覺到患者的身體開始劇烈顫抖，甚至無意識地施放出源石技藝。\n他不確定這是否是創傷的後遺症之一，但幾乎是本能地，他立刻試圖引導對方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——莎拉女士，請聽我說，跟著我深呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能聞到花香，對吧？你的身體還在這裡，這裡是一家療養院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭已經結束了，典範軍也已經回家了。你已經回到了倫蒂尼姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你現在……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他話語一頓，下意識地抬頭望向頭頂那盞破損的光照設備。\n這座城市在他眼中早已滿目瘡痍，成為一座陌生城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你在一個……一切都會變得更好的地方。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"55_g6_dusklentiavenue"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莎拉女士的源石技藝發生異變，這是以往從未在感染者身上觀察到的情況……我得請其他同事多加留意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……不曉得黛安小姐能不能幫我聯絡國際信使？如果等梅蘭德的固定信使來取信，恐怕太遲了。我得儘快為倫蒂尼姆爭取物資……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維娜","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，埃利西奧先生？你也在這？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你怎麼不攔住她？你不是一直在找她本人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"議長閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——議長？！我剛剛才看到她從地下酒館出來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是從那裡出來的。剛好遇上她去找以前的老朋友們喝酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃利西奧","speakerId":"avg_487_bobb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看來她真的把自己當成你們的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……要是不只是朋友就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃利西奧先生……我一直相信倫蒂尼姆會變得更好，讓維多利亞能為她感到驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黛安","speakerId":"avg_npc_1519_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，議長真的能做到這一切嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
